# === Unity binary data written into .asset files ===
# Unity serializes TerrainData and NavMeshData as BINARY even with Force Text, so the `*.asset text eol=lf`
# rule above would rewrite CR-LF byte pairs inside them on `git add` (silent corruption). Keep them binary, in LFS.
HarvestPanic/Assets/Art/World/Terrain/*.asset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
